en  resurrection changes one beric  Dondarrion reports that he feels more  empty and Hollow upon each death and  resurrection in reality death is a  physical process upon death several  chemical processes begin to occur  including decomposition is it possible  that the changes people like Catelyn  Stark and beric Dondarrion have  experienced upon resurrection or the  results of physical changes instead of  spiritual ones the mind is a product of  the physical brain if the physical brain  is altered by the physical process of  dying and changes within the mind would  be inevitable with the evidence compiled  it seems greatly suggested in both the  books and the show that no afterlife  exists beyond the where woods and the  potential of a skin-changer to live  within his animal death appears foremost  within the world of Ice and Fire  to be a true end where only darkness  awaits  you
 

